      "message": "fix(waterjet): ship a starter nozzle, accept it only on the waterjet op, refresh the MCP reference\n\n- assets/tools/catalog.json: add WJ-KERF-080 (waterjet_tool(0.8)), so the\n  empty-rack refusal of Waterjet Profile names a catalog entry.\n- tool_law::no_orphan_tool_kinds: the Waterjet Profile accepts the nozzle\n  and every other family refuses it (was: every family refuses it).\n- tool_gate: pin the waterjet hint row.\n- catalog_asset_tests: pin the new row against waterjet_tool(0.8).\n- docs/agents/mcp-tools.md: regenerated for the add_operation text.\n\nRefs #1883\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
