      "message": "Merge upstream/main into issue/1883-waterjet-profile\n\nResolve 17 conflicts. Each hunk keeps both sides:\n- Main's SlotUndercut (44) and VCarve (45) keep their stored ids.\n  WaterjetProfile moves to the next free id, 46. The kind table,\n  ALL_LABELS, ordinal(), the ribbon and stamp pins and the decision\n  follow it.\n- job.rs keeps main's `wire_sketch.is_none()` guard and adds the\n  waterjet arm to the selection dispatch.\n- The catalog, the catalog order pin, the tool-gate rows, the icons,\n  the DTO and the MCP add_operation text keep both additions.\n- pick_kinds.rs (new on main) gives WaterjetProfile PICK_OWED, as\n  PlasmaProfile.\n\nRefs #1883",
